-## [Unreleased]
+## [0.2.6] - 2026-11-04
+
+### Security
+
+- Upgraded locked dependencies to clear every open Dependabot alert that has a released fix: filelock 4.1.2 to 4.2.9, msgpack 1.2.1 to 1.2.4, setuptools 84.0.0 to 84.2.1, and tornado 6.5.10 to 6.6. All of these alerts were against `uv.lock`, so they affect the development and CI environments, not what `pip install aimnet` resolves. The one remaining alert is the low-severity paramiko issue with no released patch, reached only as a test dependency through fabric and pysisyphus.
 
 ### Added
 
